      <p class="small">Wrap an operation in a <b>step</b> and its inputs <i>and outputs</i> are recorded — so a replay <b>skips</b> it rather than redoing it. Several tools do this &#8212; Temporal, Inngest, DBOS &#8212; and <b>the Agent Framework has its own, which is what this repo runs</b>. <span class="k">Ours is a seam</span>: a file on a laptop today, a cloud database later.</p>
